.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_external-build-repositories-architecture.md-360-6. An existing schema-6 skill may migrate source to an external repository only by moving to schema 7, adding an exact repository lock, adding the descriptor to the external commit, switching the command to `go-repository-v1`, and reinstalling to marker v3. There is no transparent migration or fallback.
